{"id":"15a2e6c82927d21a","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-weak-versus-strong-convergence.md","title":"弱收敛不蕴含强收敛","display":"ex-weak-versus-strong-convergence — 弱收敛不蕴含强收敛","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-ex-weak-versus-strong-convergence","aliases":["56-ex-weak-versus-strong-convergence"],"display":"ex-weak-versus-strong-convergence — 弱收敛不蕴含强收敛","depends_on":["[[56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step]]","[[56-df-strongly-convergent]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Figure 12.4 and Definition 12.3.1, printed p673","source_ocr_block":"694","verification_status":"source-example-compared; witnesses-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-weak-versus-strong-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-weak-versus-strong-convergence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-weak-versus-strong-convergence — 弱收敛不蕴含强收敛"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e0030b331726af9\" href=\"?note=4e0030b331726af9\" title=\"56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step\">56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cbbb9f968fe8087\" href=\"?note=9cbbb9f968fe8087\" title=\"56-df-strongly-convergent\">56-df-strongly-convergent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Figure 12.4 and Definition 12.3.1, printed p673"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"694"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-example-compared; witnesses-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>取互异函数符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,C\">\\(A,C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\{A,C\\},\\{(A,1),(C,1)\\})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\{A,C\\},\\{(A,1),(C,1)\\})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 为与它们不交的变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ne y\">\\(x\\ne y\\)</span>。使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e0030b331726af9\" href=\"?note=4e0030b331726af9\" title=\"56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step\">56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step</a> 的位置树编码、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Step}_R\">\\(\\mathrm{Step}_R\\)</span> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9cbbb9f968fe8087\" href=\"?note=9cbbb9f968fe8087\" title=\"56-df-strongly-convergent\">56-df-strongly-convergent</a> 的序列谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon=()\">\\(\\epsilon=()\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span> 为位置串连接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_n\">\\(w_n\\)</span> 按自然数递归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w_0\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad w_{n+1}\\coloneqq w_n\\cdot(1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w_0\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad w_{n+1}\\coloneqq w_n\\cdot(1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"l\\coloneqq\\{(\\epsilon,A),(w_1,y)\\},\\qquad\nr\\coloneqq\\{(\\epsilon,A),(w_1,C),(w_2,y)\\},\\qquad R\\coloneqq\\{(l,r)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[l\\coloneqq\\{(\\epsilon,A),(w_1,y)\\},\\qquad\nr\\coloneqq\\{(\\epsilon,A),(w_1,C),(w_2,y)\\},\\qquad R\\coloneqq\\{(l,r)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\coloneqq\\{(w_n,C):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\nv\\coloneqq\\{(\\epsilon,A)\\}\\cup\\{(w_{n+1},C):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\coloneqq\\{(w_n,C):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\nv\\coloneqq\\{(\\epsilon,A)\\}\\cup\\{(w_{n+1},C):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t_n\\coloneqq\\{(\\epsilon,A)\\}\\cup\n\\{(w_{j+1},C):j&lt;n\\}\\cup\\{(w_{n+1},x)\\},\\qquad t_\\omega\\coloneqq v.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t_n\\coloneqq\\{(\\epsilon,A)\\}\\cup\n\\{(w_{j+1},C):j&lt;n\\}\\cup\\{(w_{n+1},x)\\},\\qquad t_\\omega\\coloneqq v.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\\coloneqq\\{(n,t_n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{(\\omega,v)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathbf p\\coloneqq\\{(n,\\epsilon):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf t\\coloneqq\\{(n,t_n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{(\\omega,v)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathbf p\\coloneqq\\{(n,\\epsilon):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{iTRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\\land\n\\mathbf t\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\omega+1}\\land\\mathbf p\\in W^\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{iTRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\\land\n\\mathbf t\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\omega+1}\\land\\mathbf p\\in W^\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n&lt;\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Step}_R(t_n,\\mathbf p(n),t_{n+1})\n\\land d(t_n,v)=2^{-(n+1)}\\land|\\mathbf p(n)|=0\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n&lt;\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Step}_R(t_n,\\mathbf p(n),t_{n+1})\n\\land d(t_n,v)=2^{-(n+1)}\\land|\\mathbf p(n)|=0\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\omega)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{StrongConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WeakConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\omega)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{StrongConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Figure 12.4 与 Definition 12.3.1 的例子（印刷 p673，OCR 页块694）。每一步都在根归约，但越来越深的项前缀稳定，因此只有弱收敛。距离公式直接给出弱收敛；常值零深度违反强收敛条件。这里把图示改写为完整见证序列。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"4e0030b331726af9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-strongly-convergent","status":"resolved","id":"9cbbb9f968fe8087","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-strongly-convergent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"4e0030b331726af9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取互异函数符号 $A,C$，$\\Sigma=(\\{A,C\\},\\{(A,1),(C,1)\\})$；$\\mathcal V$ 为与它们不交的变量集，$x,y\\in\\mathcal V$ 且 $x\\ne y$。使用 [[56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step]] 的位置树编码、$\\mathrm{Step}_R$ 和 [[56-df-strongly-convergent]] 的序列谓词。$\\epsilon=()$，$\\cdot$ 为位置串连接，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$w_n$ 按自